    <node id="PTK.">
      <data key="d0">JOGSZABÁLY</data>
      <data key="d1">PTK. is the abbreviation of the Hungarian Civil Code, specifically the 2013. évi V. törvény a Polgári Törvénykönyvről. In the context provided, PTK. is referenced as the legal source used to define family and relative relationships when applying incompatibility or conflict-of-interest rules.</data>
